Pangolino language data: third-party notices
============================================

The files under each version folder are compiled from the sources below by Pangolino's build
tools. Changes made: the sources are parsed, filtered and converted into Pangolino's binary
formats, then gzipped. No word list or rule is otherwise edited. Source links and jar checksums
are in README.md; licence texts are in licenses/.

Which artifact holds which source
---------------------------------
  en/tagger.bin, en/synth.bin       english-pos-dict (LGPL 2.1), LanguageTool word lists
  en/speller.bin                    english-pos-dict en_US and en_GB spelling dictionaries
                                    (SCOWL), LanguageTool spelling lists
  en/chunker.bin                    Apache OpenNLP 1.5 models (Apache 2.0)
  de/tagger.bin, de/synth.bin       german-pos-dict (CC BY-SA 4.0), LanguageTool word lists
  de/speller.bin                    German Hunspell de_DE (GPL 2 or 3), jWordSplitter word list
                                    (Apache 2.0), LanguageTool spelling lists
  de/analysis.bin                   LanguageTool data, jWordSplitter word list and exception
                                    splits (Apache 2.0)
  every other file                  LanguageTool data (LGPL 2.1 or later)

